  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle with Asian BBQ seasoning. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958adf7d5496ac4a6f2d8/step-a05ebf00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop cucumber.\n• Thinly slice red radish and long chilli (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958adf7d5496ac4a6f2d8/step-8611ff10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine slaw mix, mixed salad leaves, cucumber, radish, garlic aioli and Japanese-style dressing. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958adf7d5496ac4a6f2d8/step-04052f20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide slaw between bowls.\n• Top with Asian BBQ roast pumpkin, crunchy fried noodles and chilli.\n• Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958adf7d5496ac4a6f2d8/step-fbd05330.jpg"
    }
  ]
